  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>ANGIE&rsquo;S SHOWROOM&nbsp;<br><br></strong></div>\r\n<div><strong>A place where comfort and confidence meet.&nbsp;</strong></div>\r\n<p><em>An affordable lingerie brand that has quality, comfortable handmade pieces to inspire confidence.&nbsp;&nbsp;</em></p>\r\n<p>A perfectionist at heart, Angelina Mahany has dedicated years into sourcing, assessing and testing fabrics until she found the smooth, soft silks that became a signature to Angie&rsquo;s&nbsp; Showroom.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>This quest for creating handmade lingerie stemmed from her struggle to find intimates that made her feel sexy, confident and beautiful - without being mass-made. &ldquo;I remember thinking, it&rsquo;s so hard to find quality, soft pieces that are reasonably priced without compromising on style!&rdquo;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Originally from Moscow, this ex-ballerina has dipped her toes in Corporate Management and Marketing across Russia, France and Cyprus before residing in the United States only to realise that there was a huge gap in the Lingerie market!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&ldquo;I wanted to show the US clients something they had never seen before&hellip; lingerie that has it all. Quality, comfort and sexy styles at an affordable price! So Angie&rsquo;s Showroom was born.&rdquo;&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Lingerie made to last, remains at the core of everything we do. We are consciously working towards more sustainable solutions that protect our planet and its people.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Angie&rsquo;s Showroom is dedicated to providing affordable, high-quality intimates for people who want to feel comfortable and confident!</strong></p>",
